IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `const-candidate`

-- Commonwealth of Australia Constitution Act 1900, the Constitution ss 16, 34, 43, 44, 45, 46 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_commonwealth-of-australia-constitution-act-1900_baseline.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

§ `Fixtures`

-- Life event d060 (15 March 2040, the Italian consulate): Daniel before his renunciation takes effect.
`Daniel at the consulate` MEANS `My circumstances` WITH
    `my date of birth` IS (Date 9 4 1996)
    `I am an elector entitled to vote at elections of members of the House of Representatives, or qualified to become one` IS TRUE
    `years I have been resident within the Commonwealth when I am chosen` IS 40
    `I am a natural-born subject of the Queen` IS TRUE
    `years I have been naturalized under a law of the United Kingdom, a State or colony, or the Commonwealth` IS 0
    `my seat now` IS `I sit in neither House`
    `I am under an acknowledgment of allegiance, obedience or adherence to a foreign power` IS FALSE
    `by the law of a foreign power I have been its subject or citizen` IS TRUE
    `my renunciation of that status has taken effect under the law of that power` IS FALSE
    `apart from citizenship, I am entitled to the rights or privileges of a subject or citizen of a foreign power` IS FALSE
    `I am attainted of treason` IS FALSE
    `I have been convicted of an offence and am under sentence, or subject to be sentenced, for it` IS FALSE
    `the longest imprisonment that offence is punishable by under the law of the Commonwealth or a State, in months` IS 0
    `I am an undischarged bankrupt or insolvent` IS FALSE
    `my office under the Crown` IS `no office of profit under the Crown`
    `I receive a pension payable during the pleasure of the Crown out of the revenues of the Commonwealth` IS FALSE
    `that pension is paid to me as an officer or member of the navy or army of the Queen` IS FALSE
    `I have a direct or indirect pecuniary interest in an agreement with the Public Service of the Commonwealth` IS FALSE
    `I have that interest only as a member of an incorporated company, in common with its other members` IS FALSE
    `the number of members of that company` IS 0

